  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 2049427365888
    m_Localized: "Yo, it\u2019s the Holy Warrior of \"Op: Save the Princess.\" \nGrind
      starts today, so the WTube vid should drop tomorrow. \n\"Demon King Castle
      Speedrun\"\u2014send me those W\u2019s in the chat! \nSmash that sub button
      and bell icon! lol"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2049561583616
    m_Localized: "Is this the \"Holy Warrior\" everyone\u2019s yapping about?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2049561583617
    m_Localized: "HE\u2019S SPAWNED!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2049561583618
    m_Localized: LETS FREAKIN GOOOOOO
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2049565777920
    m_Localized: "Warrior-nim\u2026 you\u2019re literally our only hope."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2049565777921
    m_Localized: "The Royals chose him, but idk\u2026 "
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2049565777922
    m_Localized: "DGAF about the Demon King. Just don\u2019t let the Princess get
      bagged."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2049565777923
    m_Localized: If she gets kidnapped, the Warrior is cooked. lol
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2049565777924
    m_Localized: Hope the Princess has plot armor.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2049565777925
    m_Localized: "No way he\u2019s streaming this on WTube."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2049565777926
    m_Localized: "The Kingdom is in shambles, of course they\u2019re gonna stream
      it."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2049565777927
    m_Localized: Pure clickbait.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2049565777928
    m_Localized: "I\u2019m a Warrior believer."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2049565777929
    m_Localized: "Hello World. Miss me? It\u2019s the Holy Warrior. \nThe legendary
      vid is finally live: <[ENTER_LINK]>. \nEvil Eye? Mid. One-shotted. \nVid\u2019s
      a bit short 'cause I\u2019m too cracked at the game, my bad. \nStay tuned for
      more dungeon raids!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2049565777930
    m_Localized: "Wait, the rumors were true? The Count\u2019s son is a whole snack."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2049565777931
    m_Localized: "He\u2019s actually a total chad IRL."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2049565777932
    m_Localized: "I\u2019m sat. My eyes are blessed."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2049565777933
    m_Localized: Overrated. Not the vibe.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2049565777934
    m_Localized: ";; L move. He\u2019s objectively fine."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2049565777935
    m_Localized: AAA finally! [ENTER_TITLE] is life. T_T
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2049565777936
    m_Localized: Real. T_T
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2049565777937
    m_Localized: "Same. \U0001F62D\U0001F62D"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2049565777938
    m_Localized: Views go brrr.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2049565777939
    m_Localized: Hacker? Or just built different?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2049565777940
    m_Localized: Give us more content or we riot! T_T
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2049565777941
    m_Localized: "Subs are mooning right now\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2049565777942
    m_Localized: Literal world record pace.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2049565777943
    m_Localized: VTS oppas still clear though. lol
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2049565777944
    m_Localized: "Too fast to be real. If the Royals weren't backing this, I'd say
      it\u2019s fake. lol"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2049565777945
    m_Localized: Royal PR team is carrying. W strategy.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2049565777946
    m_Localized: 10M views?! Why aren't you guys hitting that sub button? Let's go!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2049565777947
    m_Localized: Imagine not being subbed yet.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2049565777948
    m_Localized: "Subbed! \u2665\uFE0F"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2049565777949
    m_Localized: GOATED // VIDEO // NO CAP // WATCH [ENTER_LINK] NOW //
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2049565777950
    m_Localized: Flying to that link rn!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2049565777951
    m_Localized: Usually a lurker, but this vid made me sub.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2049565777952
    m_Localized: "What\u2019s up citizens, it\u2019s the Holy Warrior. \nDay 2: [ENTER_TITLE].
      \nI merc\u2019d a Killer Mushroom and grilled it\u201410/10 would eat again.
      haha. \nStalk part tastes like chicken. If you\u2019re a foodie, go for it~
      \nDon't forget to Like and Sub!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2049565777953
    m_Localized: How can you even swallow that? Foul.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2049565777954
    m_Localized: Dungeon mukbang is the new meta.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2049565777955
    m_Localized: "\U0001F480 Since when?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2049565777956
    m_Localized: Bro hasn't seen "Mukbang in Dungeon" or the "Campfire Mukbang in
      Another World with My Absurd Skill?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2049565777957
    m_Localized: "I\u2019m 68 and I\u2019m gonna go eat a mushroom after watching
      this."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2049565777958
    m_Localized: "I was a hater, but I\u2019m officially stanning now."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2049565777959
    m_Localized: Real.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2049565777960
    m_Localized: "\"Hero\u2019s Princesses\" group chat is open (1/10000)!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2049565777961
    m_Localized: Sign me up (2/10000)!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2049565777962
    m_Localized: "Why does it look like he isn\u2019t even trying? Zero sweat. Sus."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2049565777963
    m_Localized: Fr... I knew I wasn't the only one sniffing a fraud...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2049565777964
    m_Localized: "He\u2019s just cracked. Cry harder."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2049565777965
    m_Localized: "Looking for the Kingdom's best chef! \nDungeon Culinary here. \nThat
      one dish everyone\u2019s yapping about! [The Taste that Snatched the Judges'
      Blindfolds: Killer Mushroom Steak] is finally here.\n\nWho\u2019s gonna survive
      the final round?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2049565777966
    m_Localized: 'lol chasing the clout hard '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2049565777967
    m_Localized: I actually vibed with the Apex Predator team's cooking... Elim was
      a scam.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2049565777968
    m_Localized: Dungeon food still gives me the ick...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2049565777969
    m_Localized: Rent free in your head.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2049565777970
    m_Localized: Watching this while hungry was a mistake.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2049565777971
    m_Localized: Knock-off version. Original Hero vid > this.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2049565777972
    m_Localized: "It\u2019s all about the temperature. Educational W."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2049565777973
    m_Localized: "[NOTICE] The Holy Warrior Global Official Fanclub \u2018Limited
      Edition Package\u2019 is LIVE! \U0001F451 We\u2019re recruiting \u20181st Gen
      Princesses\u2019 to ride shotgun on the Hero\u2019s epic grind to the Demon
      King\u2019s lair! Get in on that early bird exclusive clout and bask in the
      Hero\u2019s glory! \u2694\uFE0F\u2728\n\n\U0001F381 Limited Edition Package
      Loot:\n\n\u25CF [Legendary Holy Sword] Replica Keyring (Hand-signed engraving
      by the Hero)\n\u25CF Unreleased Dungeon Mukbang Logbook (Recipe ver.)\n\u25CF
      VIP Priority Pass to the 'Hero's Castle' Offline Fan Meeting\n\u25CF Digital
      Membership Cert (Serial No. 000001~ )\n\n\U0001F517 [Join here: Warrior-Princess-Official.com/Join]\n\n#Hero
      #HolyWarrior #Warrior_and_Princess #OfficialFanclub #DemonKingSpeedrun #Official_Princess"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2049565777974
    m_Localized: "\u2665\uFE0F\U0001F60D FINALLY! I\u2019m camping for that Serial
      No. 1... Gotta log in before the server gets nuked. PLS let me get a slot T_T"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2049565777975
    m_Localized: The Holy Warrior!!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2049565777976
    m_Localized: "WOW!! Is there global shipping? Pls say YES! I need that limited
      drop in my life!! \u2728"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2049565777977
    m_Localized: LETS GOOOOO
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2049565777978
    m_Localized: fianllyyyyy
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2049565777979
    m_Localized: Wait, unreleased logbook?? Does it have the recipe for that Killer
      Mushroom Steak? Absolute must-buy.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2049565777980
    m_Localized: "I\u2019m clicking the millisecond it hits 12:00. If I miss this,
      I\u2019m literally raiding the Demon King\u2019s castle myself."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2049565777981
    m_Localized: "1M subscribers! \nHeard it\u2019s a new world record growth rate
      lol. \nI\u2019m kind of a big deal, aren\u2019t I? \nLooking for citizens to
      grind for the Omicron Button with me (1/999999999)."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2049565777982
    m_Localized: ME ME ME!!!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2049565777983
    m_Localized: "I\u2019m the only one worthy."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2049565777984
    m_Localized: "Hero\u2019s Princesses assemble! lol"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2049565777985
    m_Localized: Dang, you gotta admit his talent is actually cracked...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2049565777986
    m_Localized: A monster rookie just spawned and shook the entire stagnant NewTube
      scene.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2049565777987
    m_Localized: "Helllo, it\u2019s the Holy Warrior. \nToday: [ENTER_TITLE]. \nGoblins?
      Easiest quest of my life. haha. \nWhere\u2019s the Demon King at? Gonna save
      the Princess ASAP. \nLike and sub!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2049565777988
    m_Localized: Warrior-nim is the GOAT T_T! Just joined the fan club!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2049565777989
    m_Localized: Welcome to the cult...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2049565777990
    m_Localized: 1212th concubine acquired.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2049565777991
    m_Localized: "I\u2019ve been waiting for [ENTER_TITLE] my whole life. (No cap)"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2049565777992
    m_Localized: 1M subs. 100M next?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2049565777993
    m_Localized: 100M? Cope harder. lol
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2049565777994
    m_Localized: "Bruh, the Holy Warrior is literally built different. He hit 10M
      in record time and has the craziest sub growth in NewTube history\u2014maybe
      do some research before yapping? The Holy Warrior checks all these comments,
      you know. Are you gonna take responsibility if you hurt his feelings? Delete
      this now or I\u2019m saving the PDF and reporting you. You've been warned."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2049565777995
    m_Localized: Screenshots taken.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2049565777996
    m_Localized: Delete while you still can.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2049565777997
    m_Localized: That typo lol. Stop, why is he so cute?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2049565777998
    m_Localized: Typo rizz?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2049565777999
    m_Localized: Report him to the guards. lol
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2049569972224
    m_Localized: He's a dude. lol
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2049569972225
    m_Localized: Fell at 00:17 lol.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2049569972226
    m_Localized: Cap.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2049569972227
    m_Localized: "The Holy Warrior is a total fraud. \nIt\u2019s all cosplay. \nFull
      expose video in bio. \nWake up, Kingdom!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2049569972228
    m_Localized: "Delete or get sued \U0001F480"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2049569972229
    m_Localized: "Are you actually insane? \U0001F480"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2049569972230
    m_Localized: "Anyone with a brain can see that\u2019s not the Holy Warrior."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2049569972231
    m_Localized: Staying neutral.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2049569972232
    m_Localized: Neutrality is just code for being a hater.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2049569972233
    m_Localized: I knew he was sus. lol
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2049569972234
    m_Localized: Delete this.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2049569972235
    m_Localized: Reported.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2049569972236
    m_Localized: Do you literally want to get sued for spreading fake news?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2049569972237
    m_Localized: "Hello, this is the Hero\u2019s Princesses. \nRecently, as malicious
      slander, the spread of false information, and defamation regarding the Holy
      Warrior have continued, we have decided to proceed with legal action in consultation
      with the Count's family. \nIf you find any illegal posts or evidence of such
      crimes, please report them to our DM or email (Hero_s_Princess@MSN.com). \n\nPlease
      continue to show your support for the Holy Warrior\u2019s journey."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2049569972238
    m_Localized: TYSM!!!!!!! Legend status.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2049569972239
    m_Localized: "Their legal team is moving at light speed lol. Who\u2019s carrying
      them?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2049569972240
    m_Localized: "Heard Hero's Princesses is full of high-tier nobles. Guess it\u2019s
      true."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2049569972241
    m_Localized: "Bro, you\u2019re officially cooked."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2049569972242
    m_Localized: lol literal justice. Satisfying AF.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2049569972243
    m_Localized: You already know how it goes~
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2049569972244
    m_Localized: A savior has entered the chat.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2049569972245
    m_Localized: Cracked. If the Holy Warrior becomes King, these guys should be
      the Cabinet Ministers.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2049569972246
    m_Localized: Is this treason? Ahem... never mind.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2049569972247
    m_Localized: "Hell-low, it\u2019s the Holy Warrior. \nToday\u2019s vid is live:
      <[ENTER_LINK]>. \nGolems are way tankier than I thought, almost snapped my
      sword lol. \nJk, if my blade breaks on a mob like that lol, I\u2019m retiring.
      \nThis ep has some insane drama, so it\u2019s gonna be a banger. \nEnjoy and
      Like-Comment-Sub!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2049569972248
    m_Localized: "Yo, today\u2019s vid is cracked;;; At this rate, the Demon King
      is getting packed up soon! You\u2019re literally our only hope! Let\u2019s
      gooo!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2049569972249
    m_Localized: "\u2665\uFE0F\u2665\uFE0F\u2665\uFE0F\u2665\uFE0F\u2665\uFE0F\u2665\uFE0F\u2665\uFE0F\u2665\uFE0Fyoung_sa
      iiiii love youuuuuuuuu\u2665\uFE0F\u2665\uFE0F\u2665\uFE0F\u2665\uFE0F\u2665\uFE0F\u2665\uFE0F\u2665\uFE0F"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2049569972250
    m_Localized: "To the Holy Warrior. Hi. I\u2019m a middle schooler who finally
      found the will to live after watching your Day 1 vid. Thanks to you, the toxicity
      in this world is fading... ...<u>see more</u>"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2049569972251
    m_Localized: Write this in your diary, bro.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2049569972252
    m_Localized: "That\u2019s actually wholesome. What, are you some kind of Hero-hater?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2049569972253
    m_Localized: Hell-low? lol cringy as hell. Disgusting.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2049569972254
    m_Localized: PDF saved. Enjoy the lawsuit. See ya.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2049569972255
    m_Localized: Why are they always yapping about suing? Go ahead, try me~
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2049569972256
    m_Localized: Looking at your attitude, you need to hit rock bottom to wake up.
      Zero mercy.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2049569972257
    m_Localized: zIrO mIrCy~~~
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2049569972258
    m_Localized: "Warrior-nim's Like Button \u2014\u2014\u2014\u2192 \u2665\uFE0F
      1.7k"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2049569972259
    m_Localized: '[ENTER_LINK] Highlights 00:00 - 10:49'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2049569972260
    m_Localized: lol That's just the whole video.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2049569972261
    m_Localized: The Holy Warrior's whole life is a highlight.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2049569972262
    m_Localized: "Controversial video: \"Warrior, it's all cosplay.\" \nNeum News
      analyzed the scene by magnifying and post-processing it. The 'six fingers'
      claimed by an anonymous fiend appear to be an optical illusion caused by the
      background. Meanwhile, \"Hero's Princesses\" announced strong legal action
      against fiend A. \n\n#NeumNews #FactCheck"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2049569972263
    m_Localized: Fr, why would the Holy Warrior lie about this? Enjoy your jail time.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2049569972264
    m_Localized: "The Holy Warrior = Officially appointed by the Crown. \nDoubting
      the Warrior = Doubting the King. \nClaiming the Warrior is a fraud = Treason.
      \nLet\u2019s go for the treason charge!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2049569972265
    m_Localized: I believed in Warrior-nim from day one.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2049569972266
    m_Localized: "You should pick your battles. Spreading fake news about the Holy
      Warrior. \U0001F480\U0001F480"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2049569972267
    m_Localized: Who do HP think they are? Why are they taking "strong action"?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2049569972268
    m_Localized: Let them be, they're just doormats anyway.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2049569972269
    m_Localized: They said they consulted with the Count's family.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2049569972270
    m_Localized: HP has so much money. Their operating budget is actually insane.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2049569972271
    m_Localized: "Hello, this is the Hero's Princesses. \nWe have received a court
      mandate stating the fan club name 'Hero's Princesses' is an inappropriate use
      of social class. Therefore, we will change our name to 'Hero's Maids' effective
      today. \nWe apologize for any inconvenience regarding the Limited Edition Package."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2049569972272
    m_Localized: Maid? Even better. I'll be the one carrying the water.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
