      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2049569972290
    m_Localized: How can a single warrior defeat the Demon King? The Demon King is
      a literal absolute being who has lived for thousands of years.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2049569972291
    m_Localized: Look at how all the "fraud" accusers vanished on this post.
