      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2049569972303
    m_Localized: Ugh, you Princess-stans need to stop. ;;
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2049569972304
    m_Localized: "Hell-low, it\u2019s the Holy Warrior. \nI\u2019m late 'cause the
      boss fight was an absolute grind. Phew~ \nVid is live: <[ENTER_LINK]>. Split
      into 2 parts 'cause it was too epic. \nSmash that like!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2049569972305
    m_Localized: HAIL THE GOAT!!!!!!!!!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2049569972306
    m_Localized: "HE\u2019S ALIVE T_T"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2049569972307
    m_Localized: "\U0001F62D\U0001F62DHE SPAWNED BACK\U0001F62D\U0001F62D"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2049569972308
    m_Localized: "You don\u2019t even have to push yourself to defeat the Demon King.
      The Holy Warrior being safe is the best gift we could ask for \u2665\uFE0F"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2049569972309
    m_Localized: "Whoa, he actually went toe-to-toe with the Demon King? Literal
      battle of the century. I\u2019m getting goosebumps."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2049569972310
    m_Localized: "[ENTER_LINK] is finally here... I\u2019m so happy..."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2049569972311
    m_Localized: "My heart literally skipped a beat. I\u2019m so relieved the Holy
      Warrior is safe."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2049569972312
    m_Localized: "\U0001F62D\U0001F62D HE\u2019S ALIVE \U0001F62D\U0001F62D"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2049569972313
    m_Localized: GOD HOLY WARRIOR.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2049569972314
    m_Localized: "Fr, debunking all the fraud allegations with one video and packing
