    m_Localized: 3:22 The Holy Warrior is actually so fine...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2049569972317
    m_Localized: I literally live for [ENTER_LINK].
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2049569972318
    m_Localized: "I was gonna end it all if a video didn't drop this time, but the
      Holy Warrior saved the country, the Princess, and me. He\u2019s a true legend."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2049569972319
    m_Localized: "What\u2019s up citizens~ it\u2019s the Holy Warrior. \nFinally,
      the last episode lol. Today\u2019s vid is the sequel to yesterday\u2019s <[ENTER_LINK]>.
      \nI\u2019m streaming live from the Medal Ceremony this time, so upload times
      are different\u2014hit that notification bell! \nlol If you watch on WTube,
      you can catch the Medal Ceremony live right after the finale. \nSee you at
      the ceremony, my cute little baby citizens \U0001F339"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2049569972320
    m_Localized: Whoa, a Medal Ceremony?!? The Warrior is literally saving the country.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2049569972321
    m_Localized: 'Correction: He already saved it~'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2049569972322
    m_Localized: "He\u2019s a national legend who packed up the Demon King. This
      is the bare minimum."
