      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2049569972323
    m_Localized: "The Holy Warrior looks insanely fine even on a live stream\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2049569972324
    m_Localized: I watched this while making fried rice and the rice literally fried
      itself.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2049569972325
    m_Localized: Warrior. Looking. Cool. Today. Too. Good. Loved <[ENTER_LINK]>.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2049569972326
    m_Localized: I just got my Omicron Button. This is all thanks to my cracked skills
