    m_Localized: "You\u2019re just salty, aren't you???"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2049569972334
    m_Localized: "The Royals have officially stated: \"The marriage between the Warrior
      and the Princess is outdated... modern alternatives need to be considered.\"
      \nAdditionally, the King shared his honest feelings: \"If we\u2019re following
      old traditions, we should follow the old format... I\u2019ll consider it if
      the Warrior clears the remaining three Demon Kings.\" \"My daughter is too
      good for someone who\u2019s only taken down one.\" \n\n#Warrior #DemonKingGrind
      #RoyalWedding"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2049569972335
    m_Localized: "That\u2019s weird, I\u2019m literally a national hero."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2049569972336
    m_Localized: "It's the Holy Warrior! \u2665\uFE0F\u2665\uFE0F\u2665\uFE0F\u2665\uFE0F\u2665\uFE0F\u2665\uFE0F\u2665\uFE0F\u2665\uFE0F"
